#: ../../../reference/interfaces/udisks2-interface.md:0
#: ../../../reference/interfaces/udisks2-interface.md:8
msgid "udisks2 interface"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../reference/interfaces/udisks2-interface.md:10
msgid ""
"`udisks2` enables access to the UDisks2 service, giving privileged access to "
"storage on the device."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../reference/interfaces/udisks2-interface.md:12
msgid ""
"When used on [Ubuntu Core](https://ubuntu.com/core/docs), the _udisks2_ "
"interface requires access enabled from a corresponding [gadget snap](https://"
"ubuntu.com/core/docs/gadget-snaps)."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../reference/interfaces/udisks2-interface.md:14
msgid "**Auto-connect**: no"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../reference/interfaces/udisks2-interface.md:17
msgid ""
"The `udisks2` slot is {ref}`unsupported for parallel instances <interfaces-"
"parallel-installs-unsupported>`. The slot owns a unique system-wide resource "
"that instances would conflict over."
msgstr ""
